{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960390/extras/header.png?t=1744332586\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CORPORATE-MANDATED CARTOON MAYHEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nutty Dungeons</strong> is a cartoony 3D action platformer with a fully-featured level editor. Everything you play was made in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the newest (and fluffiest) employee of <strong>Bold &amp; Co.</strong> \u2014 the premier kobold dungeon manufactory \u2014 you're one part design contractor, one part guinea pig.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First, create  your own absurd challenges with the <strong>Dungeon Maker.\u00a0</strong>Then, report to Faye the receptionist for some corporate-mandated\u00a0<strong>dungeon testing</strong>. You remembered to wear your heart boxers, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>OBLIGATORY FEATURE LIST</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make your own dungeons</strong> with a fun and intuitive 3D level editor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wire parts together</strong>  to make traps, puzzles, machines, or pandemonium</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Publish your designs to the Steam Workshop</strong> and share them with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use a tight platforming moveset</strong> to conquer Workshop dungeons and rack up loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enjoy a tasteful blend</strong> of retro mascot-platformer spirit and modern UX sensibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kobolds</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2960390?t=1744332586","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2960390?t=1744332586","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960390/c3cfa216a64348b90905762596a5a34530bf6340/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744332586","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960390/c3cfa216a64348b90905762596a5a34530bf6340/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744332586","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960390/extras/header.png?t=1744332586\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CORPORATE-MANDATED CARTOON MAYHEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nutty Dungeons</strong> is a cartoony 3D action platformer with a fully-featured level editor. Everything you play was made in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the newest (and fluffiest) employee of <strong>Bold &amp; Co.</strong> \u2014 the premier kobold dungeon manufactory \u2014 you're one part design contractor, one part guinea pig.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First, create  your own absurd challenges with the <strong>Dungeon Maker.\u00a0</strong>Then, report to Faye the receptionist for some corporate-mandated\u00a0<strong>dungeon testing</strong>. You remembered to wear your heart boxers, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>OBLIGATORY FEATURE LIST</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make your own dungeons</strong> with a fun and intuitive 3D level editor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wire parts together</strong>  to make traps, puzzles, machines, or pandemonium</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Publish your designs to the Steam Workshop</strong> and share them with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use a tight platforming moveset</strong> to conquer Workshop dungeons and rack up loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enjoy a tasteful blend</strong> of retro mascot-platformer spirit and modern UX sensibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kobolds</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["Cadet"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960390/0aa1227468d2d5cf798661b63b3fa4f93e762582/header.jpg?t=1744332586","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257122935,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122935/movie480.mp4?t=1744332586","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122935/movie_max.mp4?t=1744332586"},"name":"Nutty Dungeons","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257122935/f0ef6c3ae01d4cb42b7ac0ff36083515d1beb591/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744332586","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122935/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744332586","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122935/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744332586"}}],"name":"Nutty Dungeons","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and